# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own Supabase project's values (Project Settings > API
# in the Supabase dashboard). Both of these are meant to be public/embedded in the client bundle —
# see src/lib/sync.ts for why that's safe. Never put the Secret key (sb_secret_...) here; it only
# ever belongs on the server side, as a Supabase Edge Function secret.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...
